/FB 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 742 Tm
(2. Problem Statement) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(Retail traders often know they should journal, but most do not do it consistently because) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 706 Tm
(manual journaling is slow, repetitive, and emotionally uncomfortable after losses. Even) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 692 Tm
(when traders do journal, their records are usually incomplete and do not connect) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 678 Tm
(execution behavior, psychology, setup rules, and P&L outcomes.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 664 Tm
(As a result, traders struggle to answer important questions:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 650 Tm
(- Which market, session, setup, or instrument actually makes me money?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 636 Tm
(- Am I following my trading plan or trading emotionally?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 622 Tm
(- How much money do FOMO, revenge trading, overconfidence, or broken rules cost me?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 608 Tm
(- Which mistakes repeat most often?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 594 Tm
(- What should I improve next week?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 580 Tm
(Edgecipline reduces the friction of journaling by extracting trade data from screenshots,) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 566 Tm
(then converts that data into practical coaching insights.) Tj
/FR 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 34 Tm
(Edgecipline PRD | 4) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
